### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Initiate Payment
# Creates a new payment and returns a redirect URL to the payment method selection page.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/initiate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "ORD-202606012-001",
  "amount": 99.99,
  "currency": "CNY",
  "notifyUrl": "https://17b720d1-11b7-4920-ae86-e514800370b4.webhook.site"
}

### Initiate Payment (USD)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/initiate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "ORD-20260601-002",
  "amount": 15.50,
  "currency": "USD",
  "notifyUrl": "https://partner.example.com/webhook/payment"
}
